    "Admission Procedures > Exchange Program | 중앙대학교 국제교류팀\nGlobal Gateway\nCAU\nExchange Program\nHOME\nExchange Program\n소개\n협정대학\nExchange Program\n파견 프로그램\nShort-Term Program\n단기 프로그램\nAdmission Procedures\nNotice\nOverview\nAdmission Procedures\nVisa & Immigration\nHousing & Life\nAdmission Procedures\n공유\nOnline Application Process\nStudents who have been successfully nominated by the International Office at CAU partner universities will be informed on how to proceed with online application procedures.\nSubmit online application\nSubmit original documents by postal mail\nReceive the Certificate of Admission from Chung-Ang University in January (Spring) / July (Fall)\nRequired Documents\nOfficial Transcript of Home University (apostilled or certified by Consul)\nScanned copy of valid passport\nFinancial Statement with bank balance over 6,000 USD/semester.\nStudents with OECD nationality may be exempt from submitting the official transcript and the financial statement.\nAll of the required files should be uploaded in the online application and be sent in original hard copy to the OIA office.\nFor more details, please refer to the\nfact sheet\nExchange Program\nNotice\nOverview\nAdmission Procedures\nVisa & Immigration\nHousing & Life"
